        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>-Hey.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Mmmgh......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh...？ Wait, what are
you doing here!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Naruto</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What d'you mean？ We're on
our school trip!
Still half-asleep？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Wait, really...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No time to be snoozing!
Anegasaki says she needs you.
She's waiting by the river.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki...？
Wait, who gave you the right
to call her just 'Anegasaki'--？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？
She's Anegasaki, isn't she...？
Are you still half-asleep？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Dammit, why's Anegasaki
into a guy like you...？
Anyway, I passed on the
message, alright？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(What is going on...？
Guess I'll go check it out...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I wonder why ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲
called me out here...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲主人公＊▲。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm so glad...
You really came...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？
Calling me out here...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>There's something...
I just had to tell you
on this trip...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Phew...
What do I do...？
I'm getting scared after all...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That doesn't sound like you
at all, ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲.
It's okay, you can tell me.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲主人公＊▲.
How do you... feel about me？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, obviously--</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Wait!
It's fine, I know...
We're just friends, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But I... The truth is,
I've liked you for so long...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ever since we were put
in the same class freshman year...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲...
Wait.
Hold on... same class？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If I tell you this, we won't
be able to stay friends like
before, will we？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But it hurts so much...
I can't take it anymore...
So I decided.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I decided I'd confess
to you on this trip.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Please go out with me.
I love you...
I want to be your girlfriend...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well... of course.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Really？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Really!
I mean, ●, we're already--</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Then hold me!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh！？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If you really love me,
hug me! Squeeze me tight!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>S-Squeeze you tight？
Alright...
Here goes...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oww!!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A dream...？
Felt pretty vivid, though...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Nnngh...
Shut uuup...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm sorry...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Back to sleep...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Are you okay...？
You were having a nightmare...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm fine, I'm fine...</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
